// Configs/SimCamSigning.local.xcconfig.template — copy to
// SimCamSigning.local.xcconfig (gitignored) and edit, if you want to
// override the default self-signed signing path on this machine.
//
// Example: switching to your paid Apple Developer Program identity.
//
//     SIMCAM_CODE_SIGN_STYLE    = Automatic
//     SIMCAM_CODE_SIGN_IDENTITY = Apple Development
//     SIMCAM_DEVELOPMENT_TEAM   = ABCDE12345
//
// Beware: if you do this and the team's profile lacks the System
// Extension capability, sysextd will silently reject activation. See
// docs/signing-and-tcc.md.
